<title>USA: New York grain freight fixtures - Oct 21.</title>
<headline>New York grain freight fixtures - Oct 21.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Huta Katowice 60,000 tonnes hss USG/Amsterdam end-Oct $12.00 fio tend days Cargill (adds vessel name).</p>
<p>Thalia 25,000 tonnes hss USG/Buenaventura prompt $20.00 fio 5,000/2,000 Glencore (adds vessel name).</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk +1 212 859 1640</p>
